{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35611","headline":"蒲关西道中作 · 李山甫","name":"蒲关西道中作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"国东王气凝蒲关，楼台帖出晴空间。\n紫烟横捧大舜庙，黄河直打中条山。\n地锁咽喉千古壮，风传歌吹万家闲。\n来来去去身依旧，未及潘年鬓已斑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李山甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35611.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35611","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}